title: "Image-to-3D Unified Benchmark"
abstract: "A reproducible, ground-truth-referenced benchmark of four feed-forward single-image 3D reconstruction paradigms (TripoSR, LGM, SPAR3D, TRELLIS) on Google Scanned Objects, covering geometry, appearance, latency, and peak VRAM."
